abstract: >-
  A zero-install, client-side web application for teaching the Patronas
  hand method of Byzantine chant. It aligns a teacher reference video with
  a live or recorded student performance, tracks the conducting hand with
  MediaPipe, estimates vocal fundamental frequency with the YIN algorithm,
  quantises pitch to the nine-degree Byzantine scale, and scores hand-shape
  correlation and intonation in real time.
